\f0\b ### Data Description
\f1\b0 \
- # observations: 6219 observations of food waste bins or litter across 14 systematic walking transects and 7 exploratory \'93spot check\'94 surveys\
- Time period: Surveys took place from May to August 2023\
- Geography: The City of Vancouver\
- Full (exploratory) variable count: 171\
- Data types included: continuous, categorical, binomial\
