### Data Preprocessing (10 module data cleaning script: \'94 ~/src/compile_data_adjustfw.R\'94)\
####\
####### ENSURE THAT YOU ENTER YOUR PERSONAL \'93CENSUSMAPPER\'94 API KEY IN LINE 614\
### #OR THIS SCRIPT WILL NOT RUN\
### insert your own Cancensus API in line 614, which can be created at the following URL: https://censusmapper.ca/ ; and read the package info here: https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/cancensus/vignettes/cancensus.html\
\
1. gen_grids: Create 750 sq. m. grid across full geographic extent \
2. gen_foodwaste: Import & clean primary observation data, create \'93wildlife-accessible food waste score\'94 per grid cell\
	- Import food waste observation data\
	- Import survey information data\
	- Remove non-food waste observations (e.g., carcasses, fruit trees)\
	- Create food waste score indices\
	- Multiply observations by indices for a \'93weighted value\'94 per observation of food waste\
	- Create final summary score per grid cell by calculating a weighted average of the sum of all food waste observations per grid cell across all visits\
3. gen_demog: Import and clean socio-demographic data from the 2021 Canadian Census, combine with above observations per grid cell\
4. gen_lc: Import and clean land cover data, combine with above observations per grid cell\
5. gen_foodretail: Import and clean food retail data, combine with above observations per grid cell\
6. gen_shelters: Import and clean homeless shelter data, combine with above observations per grid cell\
7. gen_roads: Import spatial data on all roads and pathways, combine with above observations per grid cell\
8. gen_finalmods: read in property values from tax data, combine with above observations per grid cell\
9. gen_center_std: center all numerical data on a mean of 0 and standardize to a standard deviation of 1\
10. gen_factanal: conduct Factor Analysis on final set of variables, due to high degree of correlation among variables\
